    "rule": "Full-time Bastion induction/specialist training uses the same universal active/enrolled 48-hour-per-seven-day deliberate clock as every other professional military path. Bastion advantage comes from registered specialist curriculum, instructors, facilities, equipment and selection, not extra calendar time; hours accrue only while the candidate occupies physical Bastion training capacity."
